---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Featured from '../components/Featured.astro';
---
<Base title="Ali Rizvi">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>I build products and study how people actually use them.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Product leader and CTO with an HCI doctorate. I've shipped at Amazon Alexa, run technology for a family group of companies, and now split my time between a few ventures and applied research. I also fly.</p>
    <dl class="now">
      <dt>Building</dt>
      <dd>Scramble, a reconfigurable e-ink card platform; Bodhika Labs, assessment for Indian schools.</dd>
      <dt>Researching</dt>
      <dd>Stigma-aware wellbeing dashboards and field-access methods in HCI.</dd>
      <dt>Open to</dt>
      <dd>Principal PM roles and faculty positions in HCI or engineering management.</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <h2>Selected work</h2>
  <Featured />
  <p style="margin-top:1rem"><a href="/work/">All work, including the logbook</a></p>

  <h2>Background</h2>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>I live in Vancouver's West End, having moved from Hyderabad in 2026. My path runs through management consulting, Morgan Stanley, Affinity, and Amazon Alexa, then a mid-career PhD in Management Science and Engineering at Waterloo with an HCI thesis. I hold an MS in Engineering Management Systems from Columbia.</p>
    <p>Outside work I hold a Commercial Pilot Licence (Transport Canada and FAA, since 2019), race triathlon, and take photographs when I travel.</p>
    <p><a href="/cv.pdf">Download my CV</a> · <a href="mailto:hello@arizvi.com">hello@arizvi.com</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
